{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["无穷小比较", "等价无穷小", "定积分估阶"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "当 \\(t\\to 0\\) 时，\\(e^{t^3}-1\\sim t^3\\)。因此\n\\[\nI(x)\\sim \\int_0^{x^2} t^3\\,dt=\\frac{x^8}{4}.\n\\]\n于是\n\\[\n\\frac{I(x)}{x^7}\\sim \\frac{x}{4}\\to 0,\n\\]\n故它是 \\(x^7\\) 的高阶无穷小。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["连续性", "可导性", "重要极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由 \\(\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{e^x-1}{x}=1\\)，知在 \\(x=0\\) 处连续。又\n\\[\nf'(0)=\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\frac{e^x-1}{x}-1}{x}\n=\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{e^x-1-x}{x^2}=\\frac12\\ne 0.\n\\]\n所以在 \\(x=0\\) 处可导且导数不为零。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["相关变化率", "导数应用", "几何量变化率"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "圆柱体体积 \\(V=\\pi r^2h\\)，故\n\\[\n\\frac{dV}{dt}=\\pi(2rr'h+r^2h').\n\\]\n代入 \\(r=10,h=5,r'=2,h'=-3\\) 得\n\\[\n\\frac{dV}{dt}=\\pi(2\\cdot10\\cdot2\\cdot5+10^2\\cdot(-3))=-100\\pi.\n\\]\n表面积 \\(S=2\\pi rh+2\\pi r^2\\)，故\n\\[\n\\frac{dS}{dt}=2\\pi(r'h+rh')+4\\pi rr'.\n\\]\n代入得\n\\[\n\\frac{dS}{dt}=2\\pi(2\\cdot5+10\\cdot(-3))+4\\pi\\cdot10\\cdot2=40\\pi.\n\\]", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["函数零点", "导数应用", "极值与最值", "参数范围"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "令 \\(c=\\dfrac{b}{a}\\)，则零点满足\n\\[\nx-c\\ln x=0 \\quad (x>0).\n\\]\n设 \\(g(x)=x-c\\ln x\\)，则\n\\[\ng'(x)=1-\\frac{c}{x}=\\frac{x-c}{x}.\n\\]\n故 \\(x=c\\) 为极小值点，且\n\\[\ng(c)=c-c\\ln c=c(1-\\ln c).\n\\]\n要有 2 个零点，需极小值小于 0，即\n\\[\n1-\\ln c<0 \\iff c>e.\n\\]\n所以 \\(\\dfrac{b}{a}\\in(e,+\\infty)\\)。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["近似多项式", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由展开式\n\\[\n\\cos x=1-\\frac{x^2}{2}+o(x^2),\n\\]\n可得\n\\[\n\\sec x=\\frac{1}{\\cos x}=1+\\frac{x^2}{2}+o(x^2).\n\\]\n故 2 次泰勒多项式为 \\(1+\\dfrac{x^2}{2}\\)，所以 \\(a=0,b=\\dfrac12\\)。", "methods": ["泰勒展开"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["全微分", "偏导数求解"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "设 \\(f_u(1,1)=A,\\ f_v(1,1)=B\\)。\n由 \\(u=x+1,v=e^x\\) 在 \\(x=0\\) 时经过点 \\((1,1)\\)，两边求导得\n\\[\nA\\cdot 1+B\\cdot 1=\\left[x(x+1)^2\\right]'_{x=0}=1.\n\\]\n由 \\(u=x,v=x^2\\) 在 \\(x=1\\) 时也经过点 \\((1,1)\\)，两边求导得\n\\[\nA\\cdot 1+B\\cdot 2=\\left[2x^2\\ln x\\right]'_{x=1}=2.\n\\]\n联立解得 \\(A=0,B=1\\)。故\n\\[\ndf(1,1)=A\\,dx+B\\,dy=dy.\n\\]", "methods": ["复合函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分定义", "黎曼和", "连续函数可积性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "区间 \\([0,1]\\) 等分为 \\(n\\) 份，每份长度为 \\(\\Delta x=\\dfrac1n\\)，第 \\(k\\) 个小区间中点为 \\(\\dfrac{2k-1}{2n}\\)。因此积分的黎曼和表示为\n\\[\n\\int_0^1 f(x)\\,dx=\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum_{k=1}^{n} f\\!\\left(\\frac{2k-1}{2n}\\right)\\frac1n.\n\\]\n故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "惯性指数", "对称矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "展开得\n\\[\nf=2x_2^2+2x_1x_2+2x_2x_3+2x_1x_3.\n\\]\n对应对称矩阵为\n\\[\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}\n0&1&1\\\\\n1&2&1\\\\\n1&1&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n\\]\n求特征值可得 \\(\\lambda=3,-1,0\\)。因此正特征值、负特征值、零特征值各一个，所以正惯性指数与负惯性指数分别为 \\((1,1)\\)。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组线性表示", "矩阵分解", "齐次线性方程组", "转置矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由题意存在矩阵 $C$，使 $A=BC$。于是 $A^T=C^TB^T$。若 $B^Tx=0$，则 $A^Tx=C^TB^Tx=0$，故 $B^Tx=0$ 的解必为 $A^Tx=0$ 的解，选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵等价", "行列变换", "对角化为等价标准形", "三角可逆矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "这是用初等行变换与初等列变换把矩阵同时化为对角形的问题。检验可知，取选项 C 中的下三角可逆矩阵 $P$ 与上三角可逆矩阵 $Q$ 时，$PAQ$ 恰为对角矩阵，因此选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分", "偶函数积分", "指数函数积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{\\ln 3}$", "explanation": "被积函数为偶函数，原积分等于 $2\\int_0^{\\infty}x\\,3^{-x^2}dx$。令 $u=x^2$，则 $du=2x\\,dx$，得积分为 $\\int_0^{\\infty}3^{-u}du=\\int_0^{\\infty}e^{-u\\ln3}du=\\dfrac{1}{\\ln3}$。", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{2}{3}$", "explanation": "由参数方程有 $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}$。先求 $x'(t)=2e^t+1$，$y'(t)=4te^t+2t$，故 $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{4te^t+2t}{2e^t+1}$。再用 $\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\dfrac{d}{dt}(dy/dx)\\big/\\dfrac{dx}{dt}$，代入 $t=0$ 可得 $\\dfrac{2}{3}$。", "methods": ["参数方程求导", "复合函数求导", "隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["隐函数求偏导", "多元函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "1", "explanation": "先由 $(x,y)=(0,2)$ 代入原方程得 $z+2\\ln z=1$，解得 $z=1$。设 $F(x,y,z)=(x+1)z+y\\ln z-\\arctan(2xy)-1=0$，则 $z_x=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}$。计算得 $F_x=z-\\dfrac{2y}{1+4x^2y^2}$，$F_z=x+1+\\dfrac{y}{z}$。代入 $(0,2,1)$，有 $F_x=-3$，$F_z=3$，故 $z_x=1$。", "methods": ["链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\cos\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$", "explanation": "积分区域可改写为 $1\\le y\\le t,\\ 1\\le x\\le y^2$，故\n$f(t)=\\int_1^t dy\\int_1^{y^2}\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{y}\\right)dx=\\int_1^t y\\bigl(\\cos\\tfrac{1}{y}-\\cos y\\bigr)dy$。\n由变上限积分求导得 $f'(t)=t\\bigl(\\cos\\tfrac{1}{t}-\\cos t\\bigr)$，代入 $t=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$ 即得 $\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\cos\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$。", "methods": ["积分区域变换", "变限积分求导", "交换积分次序"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程", "特征方程", "复根情形"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=C_1e^x+e^{-x/2}\\left(C_2\\cos\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}x+C_3\\sin\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}x\\right)$", "explanation": "特征方程为 $r^3-1=0$，根为 $r=1,\\ -\\dfrac12\\pm\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}i$。因此通解为实指数项与共轭复根对应振荡项之和，即 $y=C_1e^x+e^{-x/2}\\left(C_2\\cos\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}x+C_3\\sin\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}x\\right)$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["行列式展开", "多项式系数", "代数余子式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "-5", "explanation": "按第一行展开并整理：\n$M_{11}=x^3-4x-3$，$M_{12}=x^2-2x+1$，$M_{13}=-2x^2+3x+5$，$M_{14}=2x^2-x-7$。\n故\n$f(x)=xM_{11}-xM_{12}+M_{13}-2xM_{14}=x^4-5x^3-2x^2+13x+5$，所以 $x^3$ 项系数为 $-5$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "等价无穷小", "泰勒展开", "定积分上限函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$$\\frac{1}{2}$$", "explanation": "通分得\n$$\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\left(1+\\int_0^x e^{t^2}\\,dt\\right)\\sin x-e^x+1}{(e^x-1)\\sin x}.$$ 再拆成两部分，并用展开式 $\\sin x=x+o(x)$、$e^x=1+x+\\frac12x^2+o(x^2)$、$\\int_0^x e^{t^2}\\,dt=x+o(x)$，可得第一部分极限为 $-\\frac12$，第二部分极限为 $1$，故原极限为 $\\frac12$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数应用", "函数凹凸性", "渐近线", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "在 $(-\\infty,-1)\\cup(0,+\\infty)$ 上有 $f''(x)>0$，在 $(-1,0)$ 上有 $f''(x)<0$；垂直渐近线为 $x=-1$；斜渐近线为 $y=x-1$ 和 $y=-x+1$。", "explanation": "分段写成：$x>0$ 时 $f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x}$，$x<0$ 时 $f(x)=-\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x}$。求导可得\n$$f''(x)=\\begin{cases}-\\dfrac{2}{(1+x)^3},&x<0,\\\\[4pt]\\dfrac{2}{(1+x)^3},&x>0.\\end{cases}$$\n于是 $(-\\infty,-1)$ 与 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上 $f''>0$，$(-1,0)$ 上 $f''<0$。又因 $x\\to -1$ 时函数发散，故有垂直渐近线 $x=-1$。当 $x\\to +\\infty$ 时，$f(x)-x\\to -1$，得斜渐近线 $y=x-1$；当 $x\\to -\\infty$ 时，$f(x)+x\\to 1$，得斜渐近线 $y=-x+1$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分", "由积分反求函数", "平面曲线弧长", "旋转曲面面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$$S=\\frac{22}{3},\\qquad A=\\frac{425\\pi}{9}.$$", "explanation": "由不定积分两边求导得\n$$\\frac{f(x)}{\\sqrt{x}}=\\frac13x-1,$$\n故\n$$f(x)=\\frac13x^{3/2}-x^{1/2},\\qquad f'(x)=\\frac12x^{1/2}-\\frac12x^{-1/2}.$$ \n于是\n$$\\sqrt{1+[f'(x)]^2}=\\frac12x^{1/2}+\\frac12x^{-1/2}.$$ \n弧长\n$$S=\\int_4^9\\sqrt{1+[f'(x)]^2}\\,dx=\\int_4^9\\left(\\frac12x^{1/2}+\\frac12x^{-1/2}\\right)dx=\\frac{22}{3}.$$ \n旋转曲面面积\n$$A=\\int_4^9 2\\pi f(x)\\sqrt{1+[f'(x)]^2}\\,dx=\\pi\\int_4^9\\left(\\frac13x^2-\\frac23x+1\\right)dx=\\frac{425\\pi}{9}.$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程", "曲线法线", "最值问题"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "（1）$y(x)=\\frac13x^6+1\\quad(x>0)$。\n\n（2）当 $I_p$ 最小时，$p=(1,\\frac43)$。", "explanation": "方程化为\n$$y'-\\frac6x y=-\\frac6x.$$ \n解线性微分方程得通解\n$$y=Cx^6+1.$$ 代入 $y(\\sqrt3)=10$，得 $C=\\frac13$，故\n$$y(x)=\\frac13x^6+1.$$ \n设 $p=(x,y)$，则 $y'(x)=2x^5$，法线斜率为 $-\\frac1{2x^5}$。法线方程为\n$$Y-y=-\\frac1{2x^5}(X-x).$$ \n令 $X=0$，得在 $y$ 轴上的截距\n$$I_p=y+\\frac1{2x^4}=\\frac13x^6+1+\\frac1{2x^4}.$$ \n求导：\n$$I_p' = 2x^5-\\frac2{x^5}.$$ \n令 $I_p'=0$ 得 $x=1$，此时取得最小值，故\n$$y=\\frac13+1=\\frac43,$$\n所以 $p=(1,\\frac43)$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "平面区域"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$$\\frac{1}{48}$$", "explanation": "改用极坐标 $x=r\\cos\\theta,\\ y=r\\sin\\theta$，则边界方程化为\n$$r^4=r^2\\cos 2\\theta,$$\n即\n$$r^2=\\cos 2\\theta.$$ \n在第一象限内有 $0\\le \\theta\\le \\frac\\pi4$，$0\\le r\\le \\sqrt{\\cos 2\\theta}$。因此\n$$\\iint_D xy\\,dxdy=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\int_0^{\\sqrt{\\cos 2\\theta}}(r\\cos\\theta)(r\\sin\\theta)r\\,drd\\theta.$$ \n先对 $r$ 积分，再对 $\\theta$ 积分，得\n$$\\iint_D xy\\,dxdy=\\frac18\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\sin 2\\theta\\,\\cos^2 2\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\frac1{48}.$$", "methods": ["极坐标变换"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2021", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2021, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["特征值与特征向量", "矩阵对角化", "相似对角化"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2021_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2021_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "有两组解：\n\n1. 当 $b=1,\\ a=1$ 时，\n$$\n\\Lambda=\\operatorname{diag}(1,1,3),\\quad\nP=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0&1\\\\1&0&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n2. 当 $b=3,\\ a=-1$ 时，\n$$\n\\Lambda=\\operatorname{diag}(3,3,1),\\quad\nP=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\1&0&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "explanation": "特征多项式为\n$$\n\\lvert\\lambda E-A\\rvert\n=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-2&-1&0\\\\-1&\\lambda-2&0\\\\-1&-a&\\lambda-b\\end{vmatrix}\n=(\\lambda-b)\\big((\\lambda-2)^2-1\\big)\n=(\\lambda-b)(\\lambda-3)(\\lambda-1).\n$$\n因仅有两个不同特征值，所以 $b=1$ 或 $b=3$。\n\n当 $b=1$ 时，为使矩阵可对角化，特征值 $1$ 的几何重数需为 $2$，由 $r(E-A)=1$ 得 $a=1$。此时可取特征向量\n$$\\alpha_1=(-1,1,0)^T,\\ \\alpha_2=(0,0,1)^T,\\ \\alpha_3=(1,1,1)^T,$$\n组成\n$$P=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3).$$\n\n当 $b=3$ 时，同理需特征值 $3$ 的几何重数为 $2$，由 $r(3E-A)=1$ 得 $a=-1$。此时可取特征向量\n$$\\beta_1=(1,1,0)^T,\\ \\beta_2=(0,0,1)^T,\\ \\beta_3=(-1,1,1)^T,$$\n组成\n$$P=(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\beta_3).$$", "methods": []}
